{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udde1 A GAME CREATED BY THE COZY COMMUNITY, FOR THE COZY COMMUNITY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>charming</strong> RPG where you'll discover the joys of running your own <strong>cozy cafe</strong> in a <strong>pixel-perfect world</strong>. From brewing the perfect cup of coffee to making friends with the locals, <strong>experience a blend of relaxation and adventure during your own coffee break.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong> \ud83c\udf31 Play at your own pace</strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 No time pressure, no stress </strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Simple gameplay loop and mechanics</strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Sandbox mode for decor fans</strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Perfect for a coffee break</strong><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/IntroductionTailsideSteamB.gif?t=1744994673\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2615\ufe0f PREPARE COFFEE </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master</strong> the <strong>art of coffee-making</strong> as you fulfill various coffee orders:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Prepare different types of coffee </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Unlock new options through upgrades </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/TailsideCoffeeMakingSteamB.gif?t=1744994673\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 DECORATE THE CAFE </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Personalize</strong> every corner of your cafe to <strong>your own unique taste</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Fully customizable cafe </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Different decoration categories </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/TailsideDecoratingSteamB.gif?t=1744994673\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc65 MEET VILLAGERS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet <strong>cute villagers</strong> that will <strong>help you</strong> through out your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Receive helpful tips from your new friends </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Interact and learn their unique stories  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/MeetingVillagersSteamB.gif?t=1744994673\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udd8a FOLLOW FOR MORE NEWS AND MONTHLY UPDATES ON NEW FEATURES </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is being developed based on community feedback. Join us and watch the game expand, playtest various versions, and suggest your own ideas to be added! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2922570?t=1744994673","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2922570?t=1744994673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/67ea2d6ca30bc5d9fad21af179864cb65ebad427/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744994673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/67ea2d6ca30bc5d9fad21af179864cb65ebad427/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744994673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/Timeline_scaled.png?t=1744994673\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f CURRENT DEVELOPMENT PROGRESS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Stats Last Updated:</i></strong><i> April 9th 2025 </i><br><strong><i>Current game status:</i></strong><i> Alpha version is currently <strong>live</strong> for fundraiser backers</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</strong></i><strong>\u00a0<i>General Upcoming Early Access Features (not available in DEMO)</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Expanded different drink recipes: 8/8 COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Expanded decor:  COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Village (NPC) customers: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Day and night cycle: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Bedroom area: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Accessibility: Missing Day &amp; Night cycle length setting COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Save &amp; Load system: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Controller support: COMPLETED</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Extra features:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Skill Tree: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Custom Character Import: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Shop &amp; Delivery System: COMPLETED<br>\ud83d\udfe0 Brewing and Cafe upgrades: In progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe0 Pastry buying &amp; selling: In progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83d\udd34 More to be revealed</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd34 Achievements: Not started (TBA towards end of EA development)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Fundraiser Stretch Goals Features &amp; Other:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe0 New characters and stories: In progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Sandbox mode: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd34 Cafe Terrace area: Not started</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe0 Plushie Decor Set: In progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd34 Greenhouse: Not started</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe2 Soundtrack DLC: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe0 Twitch integration: In progress</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udde1 A GAME CREATED BY THE COZY COMMUNITY, FOR THE COZY COMMUNITY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>charming</strong> RPG where you'll discover the joys of running your own <strong>cozy cafe</strong> in a <strong>pixel-perfect world</strong>. From brewing the perfect cup of coffee to making friends with the locals, <strong>experience a blend of relaxation and adventure during your own coffee break.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong> \ud83c\udf31 Play at your own pace</strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 No time pressure, no stress </strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Simple gameplay loop and mechanics</strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Sandbox mode for decor fans</strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Perfect for a coffee break</strong><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/IntroductionTailsideSteamB.gif?t=1744994673\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2615\ufe0f PREPARE COFFEE </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master</strong> the <strong>art of coffee-making</strong> as you fulfill various coffee orders:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Prepare different types of coffee </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Unlock new options through upgrades </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/TailsideCoffeeMakingSteamB.gif?t=1744994673\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 DECORATE THE CAFE </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Personalize</strong> every corner of your cafe to <strong>your own unique taste</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Fully customizable cafe </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Different decoration categories </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/TailsideDecoratingSteamB.gif?t=1744994673\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc65 MEET VILLAGERS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet <strong>cute villagers</strong> that will <strong>help you</strong> through out your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Receive helpful tips from your new friends </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Interact and learn their unique stories  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/MeetingVillagersSteamB.gif?t=1744994673\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udd8a FOLLOW FOR MORE NEWS AND MONTHLY UPDATES ON NEW FEATURES </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is being developed based on community feedback. Join us and watch the game expand, playtest various versions, and suggest your own ideas to be added! </p>","developers":["Coffee Beans Dev"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/c9427b66969e8338214a2b3c7403fde0c371cfda/header.jpg?t=1744994673","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257056267,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257056267/movie480.mp4?t=1726865249","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257056267/